  "title": "Pay the Toll: Sumrall Buries the Ole Miss Win, Braces for ‘Bloody Tuesday’ Before Missouri",
  "excerpt": "Jon Sumrall told Florida he doesn't want to hear another word about Ole Miss, and he had good news on Vernell Brown III before Saturday's trip to No. 25 Missouri.",
